        },
        "valueString": "Intermittent for several months; burning and gnawing, worse when the stomach is empty and often late at night, several hours after meals. Relieved by food and over-the-counter antacids. Over the last two weeks, pain has occurred most nights and wakes the patient 3–4 times per week."
